  "bobcat_otter_tagging": "Bobcat and river otter pelts must be tagged by an AGFC employee before being shipped out of state (unless sent to be tanned and returned). Possession of untagged river otter pelts from April 1 to the start of the next otter hunting season is prohibited except for depredation-permit animals."
